sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant Landing as Landing (React)
    participant ApiCore as api-core (NestJS)
    participant PaymentSvc as payment-service (Java)
    participant Admin
    participant Mailjet
    participant BullMQ

    Customer->>Landing: Fill quote form (name, email, phone, description, needed_by_date)
    Landing->>ApiCore: POST /api/quotes {name, email, phone, ...}
    alt Missing required fields
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Create discarded_incomplete_data record
        ApiCore->>Admin: Notify admin of discarded quote
        ApiCore-->>Customer: Error - incomplete data
    else All fields present
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Create Quote(status=pending)
        ApiCore-->>Customer: Quote submitted confirmation
        ApiCore->>Admin: WebSocket + email notification
    end

    Admin->>ApiCore: PATCH /api/quotes/:id/present {price_usd, lead_time_days}
    ApiCore->>ApiCore: Quote.status = quoted, generate signed JWT token (48h expiry)
    ApiCore->>Mailjet: Send quote email with Accept/Reject buttons
    Mailjet-->>Customer: Quote email with magic links

    alt Customer clicks Accept (within 48h)
        Customer->>ApiCore: GET /api/quotes/:id/accept?token=...
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Verify JWT signature + expiration
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Verify action_token_used=false
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Set action_token_used=true + status=accepted (atomic)
        ApiCore->>PaymentSvc: POST /payments/orders {reference_id, amount_usd, ...}
        PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: Create Payment(initiated), create PayPal order
        PaymentSvc-->>ApiCore: {payment_link, payment_service_ref}
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Quote.status = payment_initiated
        ApiCore-->>Customer: Redirect to PayPal payment link
        Note over Customer: 24h to complete payment
    else Customer clicks Reject
        Customer->>ApiCore: GET /api/quotes/:id/reject?token=...
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Verify token, set used=true, status=rejected
        ApiCore->>Admin: Notify admin (quote rejected)
    else No response in 48h
        BullMQ->>ApiCore: quote-expiration-check job
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Quote.status = expired
        ApiCore->>Admin: Notify admin (quote expired)
    end

    alt Payment completed within 24h
        PaymentSvc->>ApiCore: Webhook - payment confirmed
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Quote.status = paid
        ApiCore->>Mailjet: Send payment receipt
    else Payment not completed in 24h
        BullMQ->>ApiCore: quote-payment-expiration-check job
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Quote.status = payment_expired
        ApiCore->>Admin: Notify admin (payment expired)
    end
